00:12:13,93 --> 00:12:15,36
Why is she here?
她怎麼會在這兒?

154
00:12:15,56 --> 00:12:19,23
This could be God's way of telling us to eat at home.
也許這就是老天爺叫我們回家吃飯的方法

155
00:12:19,50 --> 00:12:23,30
-Think Riff's fired her? -No,we were there last night.
-她被瑞佛餐廳開除? -不,昨晚我們還在那兒吃飯,她不斷端來劍魚

156
00:12:23,50 --> 00:12:26,30
Are you gonna go to the...?
你不是要去…?

157
00:12:26,51 --> 00:12:31,34
-I'll wait till we order. It's her. -lt looks like her.
-不,點完之後再去 -是她吧?看起來像她

158
00:12:31,55 --> 00:12:33,98
-Excuse me? -Yeah.
-抱歉? -是

159
00:12:34,18 --> 00:12:36,15
Hi,it's us!
是我們

160
00:12:39,69 --> 00:12:42,02
Right. And it's me!
好呀,是我

161
00:12:44,02 --> 00:12:48,15
-So you're here too? -As much as you are.
-你也在這兒? -和你們一樣

162
00:12:48,40 --> 00:12:50,06
Your turn.
該你了

163
00:12:50,77 --> 00:12:54,00
-We know what we want. -That's good.
-我們知道我們要什麼 -很好

164
00:12:54,20 --> 00:12:57,00
-Two caffe lattes. -And some biscotti.
我們要兩杯拿鐵還有小餅乾

165
00:12:57,34 --> 00:12:59,14
Good choice.
不錯的選擇

166
00:13:02,88 --> 00:13:05,37
-It's definitely her. -Yeah.
-絕對是她 -絕對是她

167
00:13:12,79 --> 00:13:17,59
I can't believe you haven't told that girl she doesn't have a job.
我真不敢相信, 你還沒告訴她她失業了?

168
00:13:18,06 --> 00:13:21,03
You haven't taken down the Christmas lights.
你還沒把聖誕燈拿下來

169
00:13:21,86 --> 00:13:25,76
Congratulations! You've found the world's thinnest argument.
恭喜!你發現了世上最薄弱的論點

170
00:13:26,27 --> 00:13:28,60
I'm finding the right moment.
我只是在尋找適當的時機

171
00:13:28,80 --> 00:13:32,20
That shouldn't be so hard now that you're dating.
應該不會太難找到 因為你們已開始約會

172
00:13:32,87 --> 00:13:37,44
"Honey,you're fired. But how about a quickie before I go to work?"
親愛的,你被開除了 我上班前何不來個「速戰速決」

173
00:13:44,95 --> 00:13:48,72
Once you're inside, you don't have to knock anymore.
進門後就不用再敲門了

174
00:13:49,59 --> 00:13:51,46
I'll get it.
我來開

175
00:13:54,46 --> 00:13:57,86
-Hi,Mr. Heckles. -You're doing it again.
-哈克先生 -你們又來了

176
00:13:58,77 --> 00:14:02,90
We're not doing anything. We're sitting and talking quietly.
我們什麼都沒做. 我們只是坐在這兒靜靜地聊天

177
00:14:03,17 --> 00:14:05,80
I can hear you through the ceiling.
我可以透過天花板聽見

178
00:14:07,11 --> 00:14:09,54
My cats can't sleep.
我的貓睡不著

179
00:14:10,88 --> 00:14:14,75
-You don't even have cats. -I could have cats.
-你根本沒養貓 -我原本有機會養

180
00:14:16,28 --> 00:14:20,62
-Goodbye,Mr. Heckles. -We'll try to keep it down.
-再見了,哈先生 -我們會很小聲的

181
00:14:24,53 --> 00:14:29,43
Phoebe,do me a favor. Try this on. I want to make sure it fits.
菲比,幫個忙,能試穿看看嗎? 我想知道合不合身?

182
00:14:29,63 --> 00:14:33,59
My first birthday present! This is really
我的第一件生日禮物,這衣服真…

183
00:14:33,80 --> 00:14:38,53
No,no,it's for Ursula. I just figured size-wise....
不,是送烏蘇拉的,我只是想知道尺寸

184
00:14:39,91 --> 00:14:42,93
Sure. Yeah. Okay,it fits.
好呀,合身

185
00:14:45,21 --> 00:14:48,94
-Are you seeing her again? -Yep,lce Capades.
-你今晚又和她約會? -對,去看花樣滑冰

186
00:14:49,15 --> 00:14:54,21
This is serious. I've never known you to pay for any kind of "capade."
這回你是來真的 沒想到你會為任何花式玩意兒付錢

187
00:14:56,02 --> 00:14:57,92
I don't know. I like her.
我也不知道,我喜歡她

188
00:14:58,13 --> 00:15:01,46
She's different. There's something about her
她與眾不同,她有…

189
00:15:01,66 --> 00:15:05,10
That you like. We get it. You like her. Great!
你喜歡?我們懂 你喜歡她,太好了

190
00:15:05,83 --> 00:15:08,56
Phoebe,I asked you. You said it was okay.
菲比,我問過你而你也同意了

191
00:15:08,77 --> 00:15:10,74
Maybe now it's not okay.
也許現在不同意了

192
00:15:11,01 --> 00:15:15,57
Okay. Maybe now I'm not okay with it not being okay.
也許我對於你的不同意也不同意了

193
00:15:15,78 --> 00:15:17,24
Okay!
好吧!

194
00:15:22,12 --> 00:15:24,95
IKnit,good woman,knit!
快織,好女人

195
00:15:37,10 --> 00:15:40,36
And that's the Chrysler Building right there.
克萊斯勒大樓就在那兒

196
00:15:40,77 --> 00:15:44,93
-Nina! -Mr. Douglas. Cool tie.
-妮娜! -道格拉斯先生.領帶不錯

197
00:15:47,98 --> 00:15:49,44
She's still here.
她還在這裡?

198
00:15:50,01 --> 00:15:54,07
Yes. Yes,she is. Didn't I memo you on this?
沒錯,她還在.我沒有給你這個備忘錄嗎?

199
00:15:54,28 --> 00:15:59,18
After I let her go,I got a call from her psychiatrist,Dr. Flennan
我開除她後,接到她心理醫生的電話

200
00:15:59,39 --> 00:16:02,15
Dr. Flennan Dr. Flynn.
佛…佛林大夫

201
00:16:02,36 --> 00:16:06,45
And he informed me that she took the news rather badly.
他說她一時無法適應

202
00:16:06,66 --> 00:16:09,53
In fact,he mentioned the word "frenzy."
老實說他提到「狂暴」這兩個字

203
00:16:10,36 --> 00:16:14,63
-You're kidding! She seems so -No. Nina? She's
-她?開什麼玩笑?她…  -不,妮娜?她…

204
00:16:15,60 --> 00:16:17,47
If you asked her now...
如果你現在問她

205
00:16:17,67 --> 00:16:22,13
...she'd have no recollection of being fired at all.
她根本記不得被開除這件事

206
00:16:22,34 --> 00:16:25,54
-That's unbelievable. -And yet believable.
-難以置信 -你不得不信

207
00:16:26,08 --> 00:16:31,88
So I decided not to fire her again until she'll be no threat to anyone.
因此我決定暫時不再開除她 直到我確定她對自己或其他人不構成威脅為止

208
00:16:32,49 --> 00:16:37,05
I guess you never know what's going on inside a person's head.
人的心中在想什麼 別人永遠無法完全瞭解

209
00:16:37,49 --> 00:16:41,45
Well,I guess that's why they call it psychology,sir.
我想這就是為什麼被成為「心理學」了

210
00:16:43,86 --> 00:16:47,03
The sound Mom and Dad will never forget.
爸媽永遠忘不了這聲音

211
00:16:47,23 --> 00:16:50,47
For this,after all, is the miracle of birth.
這個,畢竟是生產的奇跡

212
00:16:50,67 --> 00:16:53,73
Lights,please. And that's having a baby.
請開燈,這一集是生寶寶

213
00:16:53,94 --> 00:16:56,47
Next week is our final class.
下周是我們的最後一堂課

214
00:16:57,68 --> 00:16:59,74
Susan,go deep.
蘇珊,準備接球

215
00:17:04,89 --> 00:17:08,58
-It's just impossible. -What is,honey?
-這太離譜了… -怎麼了?

216
00:17:08,79 --> 00:17:12,28
What that woman did.
那個女人幹了什麼

217
00:17:13,06 --> 00:17:16,89
I am not doing that. It'll just have to stay in.
我不會這麼做的.他得留在我體內

218
00:17:17,10 --> 00:17:20,50
Everything will be the same. It'll just stay in.
一切和原來一樣,他得留在我體內

219
00:17:20,70 --> 00:17:25,30
-Carol,honey,it'll be all right. -What do you know?
-卡蘿,親愛的,不會有事的 -你怎麼知道?

220
00:17:25,51 --> 00:17:31,14
No one's asking you,"Mind if we push this pot roast through your nostril?"
你怎麼知道?沒人問你,我能將這肉塊穿你的鼻孔嗎?

221
00:17:32,28 --> 00:17:36,11
Carol,sweetie. Cleansing breath.
卡蘿,親愛的,深呼吸

222
00:17:36,85 --> 00:17:39,98
I know it's frightening. But big picture:
我知道你很惶恐,往遠處想

223
00:17:40,25 --> 00:17:42,69
The birth part is just one day.
生產過程只是一天

224
00:17:42,89 --> 00:17:47,26
When it's over,we'll all be parents for the rest of our lives.
結束後我們這輩子都是他的父母了

225
00:17:47,80 --> 00:17:52,16
I mean,that's what this is all about,right? Ross?
懷胎生子為的不就是這些嗎?羅斯?

226
00:17:52,73 --> 00:17:53,89
Ross?
羅斯?

227
00:17:54,44 --> 00:17:56,63
I'm gonna be a father.
我要當爸爸了

228
00:17:57,57 --> 00:18:00,87
-This is news to you? -I knew I was having a baby.
-你才剛知道? -我一直都知道我有個孩子

229
00:18:01,08 --> 00:18:04,67
I just never realized the baby was having me.
只是不知道孩子有我

230
00:18:04,88 --> 00:18:07,78
-You'll be great. -How can you say that?
-你會是個好爸爸的 -你怎會知道?

231
00:18:07,98 --> 00:18:12,15
I can't even get Marcel to stop eating the bathmat.
我連阻止馬修吃浴室墊都辦不到

232
00:18:12,52 --> 00:18:16,58
-How will I raise a kid? -Some scientists are now saying...
-我如何養兒育女? -羅斯,科學家說

233
00:18:16,79 --> 00:18:20,56
...that monkeys and babies are actually different.
孩子和猴子是不一樣的

234
00:18:23,70 --> 00:18:26,39
You might want to look into it.
我們可以驗證一下

235
00:18:27,53 --> 00:18:29,00
-Where you going? -Out.
-你去哪裡? -外面

236
00:18:29,20 --> 00:18:30,76
With...?
和誰?

237
00:18:30,97 --> 00:18:32,34
Yes.
是的

238
00:18:32,67 --> 00:18:35,20
Can I just ask you one question?
能問你一個問題嗎?

239
00:18:35,88 --> 00:18:39,00
Have you two,you know, like,you know?
你們有沒有,你明白的,就像,你知道的嘛?

240
00:18:40,28 --> 00:18:43,88
You know,yet?
你知道的,對吧?

241
00:18:44,45 --> 00:18:48,51
Not that it's any of your business, but no,we haven't.
不關你的事,沒有,行了嗎?

242
00:18:54,13 --> 00:18:56,46
You meant sex,right?
你是指性吧?

243
00:19:08,64 --> 00:19:11,44
-Do you have a sec? -Sure. What's up?
-有空嗎? -當然,什麼事?

244
00:19:11,88 --> 00:19:17,48
The past few days,people have been avoiding me and giving me weird looks.
最近幾天,大家都避開我 而且以奇怪的眼神看我

245
00:19:18,39 --> 00:19:23,85
Well,maybe that's because they're jealous of us.
或許他們在嫉妒我們

246
00:19:24,19 --> 00:19:29,25
Maybe. But that doesn't explain why they keep taking my scissors.
或許吧,這無法解釋他們為何拿走我的剪刀

247
00:19:29,86 --> 00:19:33,73
Maybe that's because you're getting a big raise!
或許是因為你被升職的緣故

248
00:19:35,00 --> 00:19:37,13
-I am? -Sure. Why not?
-我升職了? -當然.為什麼不呢?

249
00:19:37,34 --> 00:19:40,43
Oh,my God! You're amazing!
天啊,你真是太了不起了

250
00:19:40,91 --> 00:19:42,90
You don't know.
你不知道

251
00:19:43,64 --> 00:19:47,24
Helen,do the paperwork on Miss Bookbinder's raise.
海倫,能快處理布小姐升職的手續嗎?

252
00:19:47,65 --> 00:19:52,31
You still want me to send her psychological profile to Personnel?
你仍要我拿她的心理分析結果到人事部?

253
00:19:52,92 --> 00:19:54,98
Helen drinks.
海倫喝醉了

254
00:19:55,19 --> 00:19:57,56
Will you marry me?
你願意嫁給我嗎?

255
00:20:03,36 --> 00:20:07,80
So after the proposal, I kind of unraveled.
升職後的事情,我就未經修剪了

256
00:20:08,24 --> 00:20:12,64
Right. Because you were really in control up until then.
是啊.因為你控制全盤直到那個時候

257
00:20:13,44 --> 00:20:16,50
-I told her everything. -How'd she take it?
-最後我把一切都告訴她了 -她的反應如何?

258
00:20:16,71 --> 00:20:19,74
Pretty well. Except for the stapler thing.
坦然接受,除了拿釘書機釘我之外

259
00:20:19,95 --> 00:20:22,92
A tip. If you're ever in a similar situation...
提示.以後遇見類似的狀況

260
00:20:23,12 --> 00:20:26,55
... never,ever leave your hand on the desk.
切記別把手放在桌上

261
00:20:27,19 --> 00:20:30,65
Okay,I think I get how to do this.
我知道該怎麼調成這樣了啊

262
00:20:35,36 --> 00:20:40,20
Can we turn it off? Make them go away because I can't watch.
我們能把這關掉嗎? 把他們弄走,因為我沒法看了啊

263
00:20:40,40 --> 00:20:42,30
Okay,they're gone.
好了,現在沒有了

264
00:20:43,10 --> 00:20:44,73
Are you all right?
你還好吧?

265
00:20:44,94 --> 00:20:48,87
It's just this whole stupid Ursula thing.
還不是烏蘇拉惹的禍

266
00:20:49,24 --> 00:20:54,18
Pheebs,can I ask? So he's going out with her. Is it really so terrible?
菲比,我能問… 他和她約會真有那麼糟嗎?

267
00:20:54,38 --> 00:20:55,75
Yeah.
是的

268
00:20:57,45 --> 00:21:00,61
I'm not saying she's evil or anything.
我不是說她是很壞

269
00:21:00,82 --> 00:21:04,38
She's just always breaking my stuff.
她總是弄壞我的東西

270
00:21:04,59 --> 00:21:10,39
When I was 8,she threw my Judy Jetson Thermos under the bus.
我8歲時,她把我得朱迪傑特森 熱水壺丟到公車下

271
00:21:10,60 --> 00:21:14,33
And then when I was 1 2, she broke my collarbone.
我12歲的時候,她弄斷了我的鎖骨

272
00:21:14,80 --> 00:21:18,93
She didn't mean to do it but I think it still counts.
她不是有意的,不過也算

273
00:21:19,67 --> 00:21:23,37
And then there's Randy Brown, who was like
然後,有個藍迪布朗,就像

274
00:21:23,58 --> 00:21:27,64
Have you ever had a boyfriend who was your best friend?
你們有沒有過男友身兼好友的情況?

275
00:21:30,45 --> 00:21:32,75
That's what he was for me.
我當時的狀況就是如此

276
00:21:32,95 --> 00:21:38,55
And she kind of stole him away and then broke his heart.
她把他搶走又傷了他的心

277
00:21:39,16 --> 00:21:41,99
Then he wouldn't talk to me anymore.
他從此不和我說話

278
00:21:42,20 --> 00:21:47,93
He didn't want to be around anything that looked like either one of us.
因為他說他不願再見像她的人

279
00:21:50,44 --> 00:21:55,14
I know Joey's not my boyfriend or my thermos...
我知道喬伊不是我男朋友或者熱水壺

280
00:21:55,34 --> 00:21:57,04
...or anything,but
或其他的什麼,但是

281
00:21:57,41 --> 00:22:01,91
-You won't lose him. -You gotta talk to Joey.
-你不會失去他的 -你得找喬伊談

282
00:22:02,12 --> 00:22:07,08
-lf he knew how you felt -But he's falling in love with her.
-如果他知道你的感受 -但他愛上她了

283
00:22:07,29 --> 00:22:09,35
They've been going out a week.
拜託,他們才約會一個星期

284
00:22:09,56 --> 00:22:14,46
They haven't even slept together yet. That's not serious.
根本還沒上床八字都還沒一撇呢

285
00:22:15,73 --> 00:22:18,66
Okay. Okay.
好吧.好吧

286
00:22:41,36 --> 00:22:43,52
May we help you?
需要幫忙嗎?

287
00:22:51,10 --> 00:22:54,43
What are you doing? It's freezing! Come inside.
瑞秋,你在幹什麼?外面好冷,進來好嗎?

288
00:22:54,63 --> 00:22:59,23
No,you wanted me to take them down...
不…你要我把燈取下

289
00:22:59,44 --> 00:23:03,00
...so I'm taking them down,okay?
我正在做,行嗎?

290
00:23:03,61 --> 00:23:05,41
Rachel!
天啊,瑞秋!

291
00:23:06,95 --> 00:23:09,92
I'm okay. I'm okay.
我沒事…

292
00:23:10,25 --> 00:23:12,12
Mr. Heckles?
哈克先生…

293
00:23:12,32 --> 00:23:15,69
Mr. Heckles,could you help me,please?
哈克先生…能幫一下忙嗎?

294
00:23:16,36 --> 00:23:19,92
This is just the kind of thing I was talking about.
我指的就是這種事兒

295
00:23:28,27 --> 00:23:31,36
My friend was taking down Christmas lights...
我朋友取下聖誕燈時

296
00:23:31,57 --> 00:23:34,80
...and may have broken her ankle.
從陽台跌下來,可能傷了腳踝

297
00:23:35,01 --> 00:23:38,74
My God,you still have your Christmas lights up?
你們的聖誕燈還亮著?

298
00:23:40,05 --> 00:23:43,81
-Fill this out and bring it back. -Here you go.
-填好資料後拿給我 -給你

299
00:23:48,89 --> 00:23:53,22
All right. Name,address.
姓名?地址

300
00:23:53,46 --> 00:23:56,90
-Are you currently on any medication? -No.
-你現在進行任何藥物治療? -沒有

301
00:23:57,10 --> 00:23:59,90
Oh,wait! Yes. Blistex.
哦,等等!有.Blistex（一種藥用潤唇膏）

302
00:24:01,07 --> 00:24:06,51
-No. In case of emergency,call...? -You.
-填沒有，緊急聯絡電話? -你

303
00:24:07,64 --> 00:24:10,04
-Really? -Yeah.
-真的? -對

304
00:24:10,24 --> 00:24:13,14
Oh,that is so sweet!
你真好

305
00:24:14,95 --> 00:24:18,32
Gosh,love you. Okay,insurance?
我愛你.保險?

306
00:24:18,52 --> 00:24:22,48
Oh,yeah,check it. Definitely gonna want some of that!
哦,打勾,我當然需要保險

307
00:24:22,69 --> 00:24:25,92
-You don't have insurance? -How much will this cost?
-你沒有保險? -要多少錢?

308
00:24:26,13 --> 00:24:28,92
X-rays alone could be $200!
單是X光就可能得要好兩百元

309
00:24:29,13 --> 00:24:32,96
-What are we gonna do? -There's not much we can do.
-我們該怎麼辦? -沒有太多辦法可想

310
00:24:34,13 --> 00:24:36,90
Unless I use yours.
除非我用你的

311
00:24:37,10 --> 00:24:40,66
-No,no,no. -Now wait a second.
-不,不,不 -等等

312
00:24:40,87 --> 00:24:44,07
Who did I just put as my emergency person?
我的緊急連絡人是誰?

313
00:24:44,28 --> 00:24:46,21
That's insurance fraud.
這是保險欺詐

314
00:24:47,75 --> 00:24:52,74
All right then,forget it. Might as well just go home.
好吧.算了.我回家

315
00:24:52,95 --> 00:24:57,69
-Okay,come here. I hate this. -Thank you. I love you.
-好吧,回來,我真討厭這樣做 -謝謝?我愛你

316
00:24:58,53 --> 00:25:03,09
Hi. I'm gonna need a new set of these forms.
我需要新表格

317
00:25:03,60 --> 00:25:07,93
-Why? -I am really an idiot.
-為什麼? -我真是個笨蛋

318
00:25:09,77 --> 00:25:11,86
I was filling out her form...
我替我朋友填資料時

319
00:25:12,07 --> 00:25:15,60
...and instead of putting her information I put mine.
填的不是她的資料而是我的

320
00:25:15,81 --> 00:25:18,07
You are an idiot.
你真是個笨蛋

321
00:25:18,28 --> 00:25:22,48
Yep,that's me. I am that stupid.
沒錯?這就是我.我就是那麼笨

322
00:25:24,12 --> 00:25:27,42
I had a dream. I was playing football with my kid.
我夢見我和我兒子在玩橄欖球

323
00:25:27,62 --> 00:25:31,46
-That's nice. -No,no. With him.
-真溫馨 -不?他是球

324
00:25:34,39 --> 00:25:38,89
I'm on this field, and they hike me the baby.
我在球場上,他們叫我以兒子做襠下開球

325
00:25:39,10 --> 00:25:44,00
I've gotta do something. The Tampa Bay defense is coming right at me!
我得做點什麼,坦帕灣隊的防守球員逐漸逼近

326
00:25:44,20 --> 00:25:49,11
-Tampa Bay's got a terrible team. -Right,but...
-坦帕灣隊爛得可怕 -沒錯?

327
00:25:49,61 --> 00:25:54,41
...it is just me and the baby, so I'm thinking they can take us.
但只有我和我兒子.我想我們死定了

328
00:25:55,65 --> 00:25:59,52
And so I just heave it downfield!
所以我只好傳球

329
00:25:59,72 --> 00:26:04,49
-What are you,crazy? That's a baby! -He should take the sack?
-什麼?你瘋啦?他是你兒子 -他該擒抱?

330
00:26:07,56 --> 00:26:11,05
Anyway,suddenly I'm downfield.
總之,突然我又到了前場

331
00:26:11,30 --> 00:26:15,20
And I realize I'm the one who's supposed to catch him.
我發現該接球的人是我

332
00:26:15,40 --> 00:26:18,13
I know I'm not gonna get there in time.
但我絕對來不及

333
00:26:18,34 --> 00:26:22,07
So I am running and running. That is when I woke up.
於是我跑啊跑,然後就驚醒了

334
00:26:22,28 --> 00:26:25,71
See? I am so not ready to be a father.
看?我還沒準備好當爸爸

335
00:26:25,91 --> 00:26:27,64
You're gonna be fine.
你沒問題的

336
00:26:27,85 --> 00:26:32,31
You're one of the most caring, responsible men in North America.
你是全美最細心,最有責任感的男人

337
00:26:32,95 --> 00:26:34,78
You're gonna make a great dad.
你將來一定是個好爸爸的

338
00:26:35,02 --> 00:26:38,62
Yeah,you and the baby just need better blocking.
沒錯?你和你兒子,只是需要更好的阻擋

339
00:26:41,93 --> 00:26:45,86
Have you ever been to the Rainbow Room? Is it expensive?
你們去過彩虹廳嗎?真有那麼貴?

340
00:26:46,07 --> 00:26:48,93
Well,only if you order stuff.
當然,只有你去才會貴

341
00:26:49,30 --> 00:26:52,36
I'm taking Ursula tonight. It's her birthday.
我今晚要帶烏蘇拉去,今天是她生日

342
00:26:52,57 --> 00:26:55,70
-What about Phoebe's birthday? -When's that?
-菲比的生日該怎麼辦? -什麼時候?

343
00:26:57,31 --> 00:27:02,30
-Tonight. -What are the odds of that happening?
-今晚 -怎麼會有這麼巧的事情發生呢?

344
00:27:03,82 --> 00:27:05,79
You take your time.
慢慢想吧

345
00:27:11,16 --> 00:27:13,46
There it is!
原來是這樣啊!

346
00:27:16,53 --> 00:27:19,36
-What'll you do? -What can I do?
-你打算怎麼辦? -我能怎麼辦?

347
00:27:19,57 --> 00:27:22,13
I don't wanna screw it up with Ursula.
我不想讓烏蘇拉不開心

348
00:27:22,34 --> 00:27:23,46
And your friend?
你的朋友菲比呢?

349
00:27:23,67 --> 00:27:27,57
If she's my friend,she'll understand. Wouldn't you?
如果她是我朋友希望她能諒解. 你們能諒解嗎?

350
00:27:27,77 --> 00:27:30,17
If you tried that on my birthday...
我生日時如果你敢這樣做

351
00:27:30,38 --> 00:27:33,68
...you'd be staring at the end of a hissy fit.
我就和你沒完沒了

352
00:27:36,82 --> 00:27:39,34
Saffron makes all the difference.
加上少量蕃紅花,就能使情況完全改觀

353
00:27:42,16 --> 00:27:46,22
-Okay. Monica? -Yes.
-摩妮卡? -是…

354
00:27:46,66 --> 00:27:51,56
-Yes,she is. -Hi,this is my friend Rachel.
-是…她 -她是我朋友瑞秋

355
00:27:51,77 --> 00:27:54,86
-Hi,I'm Dr. Mitchell. -And I'm Dr. Rosen.
-瑞秋?我是米契爾大夫 -我是羅森大夫

356
00:27:55,07 --> 00:27:56,80
I'm okay here.
我在這沒問題

357
00:27:57,00 --> 00:28:00,73
Actually,that's all right. You can take your break.
好吧,就這樣.你可以休息一下

358
00:28:00,94 --> 00:28:06,28
No,this is why I became a doctor. Ankles and stuff like that.
不了,這就是我為什麼做了一聲. 腳踝之類是我得專長啊

359
00:28:07,31 --> 00:28:10,44
-Aren't you too cute to be a doctor? -Excuse me?
-你當醫生是否太帥了一點? -抱歉?

360
00:28:10,65 --> 00:28:16,11
God,young,young. I meant young. Young to be a doctor. Good,Rach.
天哪,年輕,我是指年輕 你當醫生稍嫌年輕了點,說得好,瑞秋

361
00:28:16,32 --> 00:28:17,98
-Thank you. -Right.
-謝謝 -好的

362
00:28:25,63 --> 00:28:27,83
He said it was just a sprain.
他說這只是扭傷

363
00:28:28,03 --> 00:28:32,03
-You left out the stupid part. -It's not stupid.
-你忘了說我們做的蠢事 -才不蠢呢

364
00:28:32,31 --> 00:28:36,64
The cute doctors asked us out for tomorrow,and I said yes.
這位兩位帥哥大夫約我們明晚出去, 我答應了

365
00:28:36,91 --> 00:28:40,14
I think it's insane. They work for the hospital.
你根本就是瘋了,他們在醫院工作

366
00:28:40,35 --> 00:28:43,71
It's like returning to the scene of the crime.
我們這樣不是回到犯罪現場?

367
00:28:43,92 --> 00:28:47,98
-I say we blow off the dates. -What? They are cute.
-還是取消約會吧 -什麼?他們可是大帥哥

368
00:28:48,19 --> 00:28:51,95
They are doctors. Cute doctors. Doctors who are cute.
而且還是醫生.帥哥醫生?很帥的醫生

369
00:28:52,16 --> 00:28:55,09
All right,what have we learned so far?
目前為止我們學習到什麼?

370
00:28:56,93 --> 00:28:58,90
Oh,God. Okay.
天啊

371
00:29:03,94 --> 00:29:05,80
Surprise!
驚喜

372
00:29:12,88 --> 00:29:16,28
What are you doing? You scared the crap out of me!
你們在幹什麼?把我嚇死了!

373
00:29:17,52 --> 00:29:22,35
-Was that the cake? -Yeah. I got a lemon schmoosh.
-那是蛋糕嗎? -對?檸檬口味

374
00:29:22,56 --> 00:29:25,08
Come on. She'll be here any minute.
快?她隨時會到

375
00:29:25,29 --> 00:29:27,69
Hope it's okay.
希望蛋糕沒事

376
00:29:31,23 --> 00:29:34,17
"Happy Birthday Peehee."
「生日快樂?菲…」

377
00:29:34,97 --> 00:29:37,66
Maybe we can make a "B" out of a rose.
或許我們可以用玫瑰當「比」

378
00:29:37,87 --> 00:29:40,60
We'll just use our special cake tools.
對?用我們的特殊蛋糕工具

379
00:29:40,81 --> 00:29:43,00
-What's going on? -We just
-什麼事? -我們只是

380
00:29:43,21 --> 00:29:45,27
Surprise!
驚喜!

381
00:29:48,21 --> 00:29:53,95
This is so great! Oh,my God! This was not at all scary.
你們真是太好了,一點都不嚇人

382
00:29:54,15 --> 00:29:57,72
Look! "Happy Birthday Peehee."
看哪!「生日快樂,菲」

383
00:29:57,92 --> 00:30:01,26
What a strange new nickname. I like it! Oh,my God!
好奇怪得暱稱啊.我好喜歡,哦上帝!

384
00:30:01,46 --> 00:30:04,59
Hi,everybody. Hi,Betty! Betty,hi!
各位?貝蒂!貝蒂!

385
00:30:04,80 --> 00:30:08,10
You found Betty! Oh,my gosh! This is so great.
你找到貝蒂?太好了

386
00:30:08,37 --> 00:30:13,67
Everybody I love is in the same room. Where's Joey?
我愛的大家都同在一起,喬伊在哪兒?

387
00:30:16,31 --> 00:30:17,94
Did you see Betty?
你看見貝蒂沒?

388
00:30:28,39 --> 00:30:32,72
I wouldn't mind having a piece of this sun-dried tomato business.
蕃茄幹事業真好賺

389
00:30:32,93 --> 00:30:37,76
Five years ago,if somebody had said, "A tomato that's like a prune"...
五年前如果有人說我的蕃茄像李子

390
00:30:37,96 --> 00:30:40,63
... I'd have said,"Get out!"
我就叫他滾出我的辦公室

391
00:30:43,24 --> 00:30:46,10
Dad,before I was born, did you freak out?
爸?我出生前你會緊張嗎?

392
00:30:46,31 --> 00:30:50,74
I'm not freaking out! I'm saying, if someone had come to me
我不緊張,我是說如果有人對我說…

393
00:30:50,94 --> 00:30:54,81
Dad,I'm talking about the whole baby thing.
爸?我在談小孩的事

394
00:30:55,05 --> 00:30:57,88
Did you ever get this sort of...
你是否曾因為

395
00:30:58,15 --> 00:31:02,21
... panicky,"Oh,my God, I'm gonna be a father" thing?
將成為父親而緊張?

396
00:31:02,99 --> 00:31:06,62
No. We just had kids back then.
不會.我們只是要回收種子

397
00:31:06,83 --> 00:31:12,39
We didn't think about it. What else could the sun dry,I wonder?
我們根本就不想這些. 我在想除了曬乾還能怎麼辦?

398
00:31:12,60 --> 00:31:14,09
Dad,come on. IKids.
老爸,不要這樣,我們在說孩子

399
00:31:14,30 --> 00:31:19,29
Look,your mother really did the work. I was busy with the business.
都是你媽在處理,我忙著事業

400
00:31:19,51 --> 00:31:23,57
I wasn't around that much. Is that what this is about?
經常不在家,你找我來是為了這個?

401
00:31:23,78 --> 00:31:25,54
No,I was just wondering.
不是?我只是有點迷惑

402
00:31:25,75 --> 00:31:29,18
We can make up for that. We can do stuff together.
因為我們有時間彌補 我們可以一起做某些事

403
00:31:29,45 --> 00:31:34,44
You always wanted to go to Colonial Williamsburg. Let's do that.
你一直想去威廉斯堡,想去嗎?

404
00:31:34,65 --> 00:31:39,18
Thanks,Dad,really. You know,I just....
謝了,爸.我只是

405
00:31:39,86 --> 00:31:42,12
I just needed to know...
我只是想知道

406
00:31:42,33 --> 00:31:45,89
...when did you start to feel like a father?
你何時感覺自己像個父親

407
00:31:46,90 --> 00:31:51,77
Well,I guess it must've been the day after you were born.
應該是你出生那一天

408
00:31:52,37 --> 00:31:55,71
We were in the hospital room, your mom was asleep...
我們在病房,你媽在睡覺

409
00:31:55,91 --> 00:31:59,47
...and they brought you in and gave you to me.
他們把你交給我

410
00:31:59,68 --> 00:32:03,12
You were this ugly little red thing.
你當時又醜又紅又小

411
00:32:03,32 --> 00:32:07,51
All of a sudden you grabbed my finger with your fist...
你突然用拳頭緊抓住我的手指

412
00:32:07,75 --> 00:32:11,59
...and you squeezed it so tight.
緊緊捏住我的手指

413
00:32:13,16 --> 00:32:15,53
And that's when I knew.
那時候我才感覺到

414
00:32:18,10 --> 00:32:21,40
So you don't wanna go to Williamsburg?
你不想去威廉斯堡?

415
00:32:24,14 --> 00:32:26,40
We can go to Williamsburg.
我們可以去阿

416
00:32:27,54 --> 00:32:29,74
Eat your fish.
吃魚吧

417
00:32:33,45 --> 00:32:37,54
-Rachel,the cute doctors are here! -Okay,coming.
-瑞秋?帥哥醫生來了! -來了

418
00:32:37,75 --> 00:32:40,45
-Hi,come on in. -Hi,Jeffrey.
-請進 -你好,麥可.傑佛瑞

419
00:32:41,72 --> 00:32:42,81
We brought wine.
我們帶了一瓶酒

420
00:32:43,02 --> 00:32:47,48
Look. It's from the cellars of Ernest and Tova Borgnine.
這是來自恩尼斯及托夫波尼酒窖

421
00:32:47,79 --> 00:32:49,96
-How could we resist? -That's great!
-我們怎麼能夠拒絕呢? -太好了!

422
00:32:50,50 --> 00:32:53,80
-Monica,how's the ankle? -It's....
-摩妮卡,腳踝如何? -它啊

423
00:32:55,23 --> 00:32:59,40
Why don't you tell them? After all,it is your ankle.
你何不告訴他們,這可是你的腳踝

424
00:32:59,61 --> 00:33:02,70
It's feeling a lot better. Thank you.
感覺好多了,謝謝

425
00:33:02,98 --> 00:33:06,71
Why don't you guys sit down, and we'll get you some glasses?
你們請坐我去拿杯子

426
00:33:06,91 --> 00:33:10,11
Okay. Stat!
快坐好

427
00:33:13,22 --> 00:33:18,52
Why don't we just tell them who we really are? It'll be fine.
我們何不表明我們的身份 絕對不會有事的

428
00:33:18,73 --> 00:33:22,92
-We'll get in trouble. -Would you stop being such a wuss?
-我們會惹上大麻煩 -摩妮卡,別那麼不爭氣

429
00:33:23,13 --> 00:33:27,00
A wuss? Excuse me for living in the real world.
不爭氣?抱歉,我生在真實的世界之中

430
00:33:27,20 --> 00:33:29,50
-So? -So they still seem normal.
所以呢?她們似乎很正常

431
00:33:29,74 --> 00:33:31,07
Because they are.
但你得承認

432
00:33:31,27 --> 00:33:34,50
When we go out with women from the hospital
每次我們和女病患約會都…

433
00:33:34,71 --> 00:33:39,94
Relax. Take a look around. There are no pagan altars.
別緊張,看看四周.沒有異教徒的神壇

434
00:33:40,71 --> 00:33:46,12
No piles of bones in the corners. They're fine. Go like this:
角落沒有成堆的骨頭, 她們沒事的,這個…

435
00:33:49,66 --> 00:33:54,06
We're not going to do it. Sometimes you can be such a baby!
我們絕不能這麼做,有時你真的很幼稚

436
00:33:54,26 --> 00:33:57,49
-I am not a baby. -Be serious. Every time
-我才不幼稚 -嚴格來說,每次都是

437
00:33:57,70 --> 00:34:00,83
-You act like a princess. -You know what?
-你嬌生慣養… -你知道嗎?

438
00:34:01,03 --> 00:34:06,70
Every day you are becoming more and more like your mother. Excuse me.
你愈來愈像你媽了

439
00:34:06,91 --> 00:34:08,37
Here we go.
來

440
00:34:09,68 --> 00:34:12,30
Great place. How long have you lived here?
這房子好漂亮,住在這兒多久了?

441
00:34:12,51 --> 00:34:15,48
I've been here about six years.
謝謝,我住在這兒六年了

442
00:34:15,68 --> 00:34:18,98
And Rachel moved in a few months ago.
瑞秋幾個月從才搬來

443
00:34:19,72 --> 00:34:25,18
See,I was supposed to get married, but I left the guy at the altar.
對,我本來應該結婚的 但我在聖堂前離開了新郎

444
00:34:28,43 --> 00:34:30,16
-Really? -Yeah.
-真的? -是的

445
00:34:30,36 --> 00:34:36,10
Yeah,I know it's pretty selfish, but hey,that's me!
對,我知道我很自私 但我就是這種人

446
00:34:39,71 --> 00:34:43,14
-Try the hummus. -Monica,what do you do?
-試試這個鷹嘴豆沙 -摩妮卡,你從事什麼工作?

447
00:34:43,34 --> 00:34:46,64
I am a chef at a restaurant uptown.
我在上城區一家餐廳的總廚師

448
00:34:46,85 --> 00:34:49,87
-Good for you. -Yeah,it is.
-真有你的 -沒錯

449
00:34:50,48 --> 00:34:56,22
Mostly because I get to boss people around,which I just love to do.
因為我喜歡指使別人

450
00:34:57,86 --> 00:35:01,59
-This hummus is great. -God bless the chickpea.
-這個鷹嘴豆沙不錯. -上帝保佑鷹嘴豆

451
00:35:06,33 --> 00:35:10,36
Oh,God! I am so spoiled!
我真是被寵壞了

452
00:35:14,64 --> 00:35:16,20
That's it.
就這樣了

453
00:35:17,44 --> 00:35:19,24
I shoplift.
我偷東西

454
00:35:21,88 --> 00:35:26,41
You had no idea that lipstick was in your pocket.
你絕對想不到唇膏在我的口袋中

455
00:35:26,62 --> 00:35:30,78
Did I tell you that I think I'm so much cuter than I am?
我告訴過你們我比原來可愛多了嗎?

456
00:35:31,92 --> 00:35:36,16
And have I mentioned that back in high school I was a cow?
對了,我有提過,我在高中是條肥豬?

457
00:35:38,43 --> 00:35:40,96
I used to wet my bed.
我常尿床

458
00:35:41,40 --> 00:35:44,30
I use my breasts to get people's attention.
我以胸部吸引別人的注意

459
00:35:44,60 --> 00:35:46,44
We both do that!
我們都一樣

460
00:36:00,75 --> 00:36:03,48
Monica and Rachel's apartment.
摩妮卡與瑞秋的公寓

461
00:36:04,59 --> 00:36:07,75
