打給餐廳時他們說她太忙

500
00:38:57,83 --> 00:39:00,56
I can't believe she's blowing me off!
我不敢相信她想甩掉我

501
00:39:17,48 --> 00:39:21,21
-We had the two chef salads. -And how were they?
-我們吃了兩份主沙拉 -我們還能怎樣?

502
00:39:22,59 --> 00:39:28,03
No,we haven't had them yet. We're still hoping to have them.
不,我們還沒有吃.我們只是希望吃那個

503
00:39:28,23 --> 00:39:29,52
Okay.
好吧

504
00:39:41,11 --> 00:39:45,94
-You got a minute? -Yeah,I'm just working.
-有空嗎? -有,我只是在工作

505
00:39:54,25 --> 00:39:55,98
So.
那…

506
00:39:57,69 --> 00:40:01,72
-I got you a birthday present. -Wow,you remembered.
-我為你買了生日禮物 -嗚,你記得

507
00:40:07,50 --> 00:40:11,13
-It's a Judy Jetson thermos. -Like the kind you
-是個茱蒂傑森熱水壺 -對,像你…

508
00:40:11,34 --> 00:40:15,33
Right. Oh,I got something for you too.
對,我也有東西送你

509
00:40:15,54 --> 00:40:20,88
-How'd you know I was coming? -Yeah,twin thing.
-你怎知道我會來? -我們是雙胞胎嘛

510
00:40:22,65 --> 00:40:24,67
I can't believe you did this.
我不敢相信你會這麼做

511
00:40:24,88 --> 00:40:28,79
I can't believe you did this.
我不敢相信你會這麼做

512
00:40:30,72 --> 00:40:35,06
So,what's the deal with you and Joey?
你和喬伊之間呢?

513
00:40:35,90 --> 00:40:40,20
Oh,right. He is so great. But that's over.
他人很好,但我們結束了

514
00:40:41,07 --> 00:40:42,97
-Does he know? -Who?
-他知道嗎? -誰?

515
00:40:43,84 --> 00:40:48,47
Joey. You know, he's really nutsy about you.
喬伊.他對你著迷不已

516
00:40:48,67 --> 00:40:51,73
-He is? Why? -You got me.
-是嗎?為什麼? -你可把我問倒了

517
00:40:51,94 --> 00:40:56,90
Right. Excuse me,doesn't this come with a side salad?
沒錯.抱歉,這道菜不是有沙拉嗎?

518
00:40:58,28 --> 00:41:00,22
So are you gonna call him?
你會打電話給他嗎?

519
00:41:00,42 --> 00:41:03,32
-You think he likes me? -No. Joey.
-你認為他喜歡我? -不,是喬伊

520
