Oh! No,he is so smart. He'll figure it out.
不,他很聰明,他會瞭解的

521
00:41:08,59 --> 00:41:10,79
Do you want some chicken?
想吃雞肉?

522
00:41:11,00 --> 00:41:13,36
No. No food with a face.
不.有臉的食物不吃,記得嗎?

523
00:41:14,27 --> 00:41:18,83
-You have not changed. -Yeah,you too.
-你還是沒變 -你也一樣

524
00:41:19,27 --> 00:41:23,71
Thanks. Excuse me? My side salad?
謝謝.抱歉?我的沙拉在哪?

525
00:41:25,34 --> 00:41:29,58
Service here is horrible. Now I know what people mean.
這裡的服務很差.現在我明白為什麼了

526
