00:43:18,09 --> 00:43:23,22
-Get that animal out! -The animal hospital is across town.
-把你的動物帶走! -不,你不懂.動物醫院離這兒很遠

551
00:43:23,43 --> 00:43:26,92
-What's going on? -Marcel swallowed a Scrabble tile.
-怎麼回事? -馬修吞了一個字母

552
00:43:28,23 --> 00:43:31,29
Excuse me. This hospital is for people!
抱歉,這是為人看病的醫院

553
00:43:31,50 --> 00:43:34,27
He is people! He has a name,okay?
小姐,它是人,他有名字

554
00:43:34,47 --> 00:43:39,71
He watches Jeopardy!,he touches himself when nobody's watching.
他看守「幸運輪」,沒人看時它就摸自己

555
00:43:40,08 --> 00:43:41,84
Please,have a heart.
拜託,發揮你的愛心

556
00:43:42,05 --> 00:43:44,28
-I'll take a look at him. -Thanks.
-我替它看看 -謝謝

557
00:43:44,48 --> 00:43:45,58
-Michael! -Rachel.
-麥克! -瑞秋

558
00:43:45,78 --> 00:43:47,84
-What? -Monica.
-什麼? -莫尼卡

559
