Don't say "listen." I know that "listen." I've said that.
不,別叫我聽.我知道你的意思 我也叫人聽我說過

562
00:44:14,81 --> 00:44:18,77
-I'm sorry. -I don't get it. What happened?
-抱歉 -我不懂,你怎麼了?

563
00:44:18,98 --> 00:44:21,98
What about what you said under the bridge?
你在橋下說過的話呢?

564
