Then yeah,it's because of Phoebe.
沒錯,就是因為她

573
00:45:00,79 --> 00:45:03,85
So,you know,it's either her or me.
所以,不是她就是我

574
00:45:06,40 --> 00:45:08,56
Then I'm sorry.
那麼我只能說抱歉了

575
